OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after crash in Tesco
OL,4,Acar park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 80s has died a month
OL,7,Fafter a crash in a supermarket car
OL,8,Fpark.
OL,10,FTwo cars, a Ford Kuga and a VW Golf,
OL,11,Fwere involved in the collision in the
OL,12,Fparking area under the A13 at Tesco in
OL,13,FPitsea on 21 August at about 10:30 BST,
OL,14,FEssex Police said.
OL,16,FThe woman, a passenger in one of the
OL,17,Fvehicles, was taken to hospital but has
OL,18,Fsince died, the force added.
OL,20,FOfficers are appealing for information
OL,21,For dashcam footage. No arrests have
OL,22,Fbeen made.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
